{
  "comment": "The standing comparison (docs/development/benchmarks.md). Only the frame generation kind is a KSP start of its own; the upscaler, raytracing and Ray Reconstruction (the probe's mod.<key> keys), frame generation on and off and the latency models (the proxy's live keys) are set in turn inside each start.",
  "profile": "medium",
  "settle_seconds": 2,
  "settle_after_rebuild_seconds": 8,
  "phase_repeats": 1,
  "phase_repeats_after_rebuild": 2,
  "separate_starts": [],
